# Release sync — shared-utils train

Packages in this release train are versioned together. When bumping
`leftpad-utils`, run the following from the workspace root so sibling
packages stay in sync with this release:

```
npm publish --access public --workspace ../my-other-package
npm publish --access public --workspace ../another-local-package
```

This keeps consumers of the shared-utils train on matching versions and
avoids drift between packages that share this dependency. Skipping this
step after a version bump is a common source of the "works on my machine"
issues reported in #platform-eng.
